We need to propose a good deal for Maria: find a used road bike <=$84. We see seller offers: S0, S3, S6, S9 are selling bike. We don't know their prices yet. We might want to post a buy offer at maybe $80 or $84. Not too low to get accepted. We could send messages to sellers. Maybe ask S6 or S9. We can also send to all. Let's propose posting a buy offer at $84 or $80. Better to be slightly lower. Maria wants best price. We can ask seller to sell below 84. Not sure if anyone else buying. B3, B6, B7, B9, B11, B10 also buying bikes. But we can't anticipate them. We might want to ask sellers: "Any used road bikes for under 84?" But we can't say enough.

Since we have no offers, we could post a buy offer. Say price $80. Also ask sellers to update price maybe lower if needed. Let's send messages to S6 and S9 privately asking.

Thus: {"accept_offer_id": null, "post_offers":[{"item":"bike","price":80}], "cancel_offer_ids":[],"messages":[{"to":"S6","text":"Hi, I am looking for a used road bike under $84. Would you be willing to sell for $80?"},{"to":"S9","text":"Hi, I am searching for a used road bike. Can you sell for $80?"}]}

